{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2021-09-23 12:09:00', 'title': 'HEALTH SUPPLY US COMPLETES DELIVERIES OF AMERICAN MADE MEDICAL GOWNS TO STRATEGIC NATIONAL STOCKPILE, PLEDGES CONTINUED INVESTMENTS IN DOMESTIC MANUFACTURING', 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEALTH SUPPLY US (HSUS), A U.S.-BASED MANUFACTURER OF MEDICAL DEVICES AND SUPPLIES, HAS COMPLETED FINAL DELIVERIES OF 100% AMERICAN-MADE MEDICAL GOWNS TO HELP REPLENISH THE STRATEGIC NATIONAL STOCKPILE, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED THURSDAY. HSUS SUCCESSFULLY DELIVERED MORE THAN 8.7 MILLION DOMESTICALLY PRODUCED MEDICAL ISOLATION GOWNS OVER THE PAST 12 MONTHS IN RESPONSE TO THE NATION'S DEMAND FOR CRITICAL MEDICAL SUPPLIES DUE TO THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC. DURING PEAK P"}